   {
      "id": "L-S1E05-C03",
      "title": "Hope and Landon use the the supernatural lie detector ",
      "description": "Hope and Landon use the supernatural lie detector about his storry and the question of why he took the knife.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [

      ],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "tests",
        "identity",
        "adoption",
        "knife",
        "school"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [


          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "What's your name?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Landon Kirby."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "See? That's the truth. Now lie. What's your favorite food?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Rabbit. So it's a... supernatural lie detector."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Pretty much your worst nightmare."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Bring it on, Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Where were you born?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I don't know."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Who are your parents?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "My mom's name is Seylah. That's pretty much all I know. She gave me up for adoption when I was young."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And your dad?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Never met him."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Why can't you be compelled?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I have no idea. A couple days ago, I didn't even know what compulsion was."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Why'd you take the knife?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I don't know. I don't... I remember doing it, but I don't remember why."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "It's not good enough If we can't figure out what you are, then you can't stay at this school.."
          }
  
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "So it's a... supernatural lie detector."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Pretty much your worst nightmare."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C03-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Bring it on, Hope."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    

    {
      "id": "L-S1E05-C04",
      "title": "Landon apologizes using the lie detector and Hope accepts it",
      "description": "Landon apologizes using the lie detector and Hope accepts it",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [

      ],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "sorry",
        "thank you",
        "dissapoint",
        "comfort"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [


          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "You said you'd help me get answers."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I didn't even want to do this. Don't blame me because you're not special."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I apologized for lying to you. I explained why I took the knife. Why are you still so mad at me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm not mad. I couldn't care less."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Fine. It's easier to be mad."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Why?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Because it is"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Or maybe it's because you feel like if you stop being mad you're letting your guard down, and the legendary Hope Mikaelson couldn't possibly do that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "When I let my guard down, people disappoint me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Growing up in the foster system...every time I got sent someplace new, I'd hope that this would be the right place. You know, like, uh,click your heels three times, no place like home kind of stuff. Just somewhere I actually belonged. But it never was. You know, and you can only hold out hope for so long and-and be hurt by so many people before its starts to seems impossible to trust someone new. Especially when they lie to you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "So, for the last time, I'm sorry. I broke your trust. I don't want to do it again."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Thank you"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "But if this goes the wrong way, can you just make sure that Raf doesn't, um, follow me this time? As much as I want to stay here, he needs to. He finally found a home he deserves. I'm not gonna take that away from him."
          }
          
  
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "When I let my guard down, people disappoint me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Growing up in the foster system...every time I got sent someplace new, I'd hope that this would be the right place. You know, like, uh,click your heels three times, no place like home kind of stuff. Just somewhere I actually belonged. But it never was. You know, and you can only hold out hope for so long and-and be hurt by so many people before its starts to seems impossible to trust someone new. Especially when they lie to you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "So, for the last time, I'm sorry. I broke your trust. I don't want to do it again."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Thank you"
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    
    {
      "id": "L-S1E05-C05",
      "title": "Hope takes care of Landon",
      "description": "Hope takes care of Landon after Jed's attack",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Rafael",
          "version": "Rafael"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [

      ],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "sorry",
        "heal",
        "protect",
        "comfort"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [


          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "I'm gonna tear Jed apart."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No, you're really not."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Rafael",
              "version": "Rafael"
            },
            "text": "He's gonna pay for what he did. He could've killed him."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You want to do something to help him? Take a walk to the herb garden and get me some hazelwood root."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "What does hazelwood root do?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Make him cool off before he realizes that I made it up."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Raf's had a... a rough couple of weeks."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Look who's talking. Guess we can cross supernatural healing off the list."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm sorry that this happened to you. Jed's one of those rare cases where his bite is actually worse than his bark."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I've dealt with bullies before."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Not like this. I know how badly you want to stay here, but this school is full of people like Jed. Some of us are nicer, some of us have more control, but all of us are capable of doing what he did. Do you honestly think that you're safe here?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yes, I do."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You should rest"
          }
  
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Raf's had a... a rough couple of weeks."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Look who's talking. Guess we can cross supernatural healing off the list."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm sorry that this happened to you."
          }
        ]
      }
