    {
      "id": "L-S1E05-C07",
      "title": "Hope walks Landon to the bus stop",
      "description": "Hope walks Landon to the bus stop, accepts she is biased, helps him and kiss",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [
      ],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "goodbye",
        "care",
        "biased",
        "family",
        "bracelet",
        "kiss",
        "sorry",
        "comfort",
        "romantic",
        "make out"
      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Thanks for walking me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I had to go before Rafael tried to follow me again."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "We didn't take the vote lightly. It was close."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, I don't really need to hear about that. I'm in enough pain as it is."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I voted no."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Didn't need to know that. Why, exactly?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Remember when you asked me to make sure that Raf didn't follow you? You did it 'cause you care about him, because... you wanted to do what was right for him. Even though it was hard."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Is that your way of admitting you care about me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Maybe I'm a little biased."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "New Orleans."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I have a family friend there that's expecting you. I asked him to help you find your birth mom."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "What?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I couldn't get you the answers that you wanted, but he can. With this. I put the results of your lineage spell in there. And, um, some money. And a sandwich. I hope you like ham."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Thank you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Oh, and, um... and this."
          },
   
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "What is this?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Think of it like a... 'click your heels together three times' kind of thing. If you ever need me, just press it, and my bracelet will lead me to you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I should go."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Bye. Bye, Landon."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I wanted to see if it worked."
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C07-T24",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Handon",
          "version": "Handon"
        },
        "action": "kiss"
      },
        
      {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T25",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Ow. Ooh"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T26",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Sorry. Sorry."
          },

          {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T27",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's good. It's okay. It's worth it. It's worth it"
          },
           {
            "id": "L-S1E05-C07-T28",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
